  "content": "<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - Beekeeper Hut\" title=\"Friends&amp;Foes - Beekeeper Hut\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Join Our Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Friends&Foes - Beekeeper Hut 是一個小型擴充，添加了蜜蜂小屋結構。該結構可在草地和花海生物群系中找到。您可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">wiki</a> 以獲取有關養蜂人的更多信息。</span>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut1.png\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut1.png\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"Beekeeper Hut\" title=\"Beekeeper Hut\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut2.png\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut2.png\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"Beekeeper Hut\" title=\"Beekeeper Hut\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ Other addons / datapacks</h1>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-forge\">Friends&Foes - Flowery Mooblooms</a></li>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes Compat Datapack</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 Community</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">Discord 社區</a> 來聊天、分享您的作品、提出問題或僅僅是了解 MOD 的最新開發動態，並在有新版本發布時收到通知。此外，請不要猶豫通過 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/issues\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">GitHub issues</a> 報告任何崩潰或錯誤。</span>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>👋 Support</h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">無論是否獲得支持，我都會繼續開發我的 MOD，這是我的愛好，儘管我大部分的自由時間都投入到 MOD 的開發中。因此，如果您仍然想支持我，可以通過 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a> 進行支持。對此，我非常感謝您的所有支持。</span></p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 License</h1>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本 MOD 採用 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 許可證。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">歡迎查看我的代碼，以瞭解我在開發此 MOD 時如何實現和解決各種問題，並將片段整合到您的代碼中。也歡迎將本 MOD 用於任何 MOD 包（雖然非常感謝您提供指紋/鏈接返回到本頁面）。</span>\n</p>",
